  company_directory,"Still not built, but NO LONGER BLOCKED as of 2026-09-08: GET /api/Companies takes Page/Size and works. gap CO-04 and this row both used to say no company list endpoint existed - that is now false. Note SEC-01 before wiring it: that response still carries plaintext username/password"
